<title>USA: Intel launches Chips offer.</title>
<headline>Intel launches Chips offer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intel Corp on Friday formally launched  its $17.50 per share tender offer for all the shares of Chips and  Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Last week, Intel announced its intention to acquire Chips and Technologies,  the San Jose-based maker of specialized graphics hardware and other  devices for personal computers.</p>
</text>
